  "description": "4 Golden Signals — Weather Collector & Flask app. Every metric exemplar carries dual drilldowns: Tempo trace + Loki logs. Trace table rows link to both Tempo and Loki. Log lines have a derived TraceID field that links back to Tempo.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "datasource",
        "uid": "-- Mixed --"
      },
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 99,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "## Drilldown chain\n**Metric exemplar dot** → click the scatter dot on any time-series panel → choose:\n- **→ Tempo: view trace** — opens the full span waterfall for that exact request\n- **→ Loki: logs for this trace** — opens Loki filtered to `trace_id=<id>` so you see every log line that span emitted\n\n**Trace table row** (Traces section) → click the `traceID` cell → same two links above.\n\n**Log line** (Logs section) → expand a log entry → click the **TraceID** derived-field pill → jumps back to Tempo.\n\n*To enable the in-waterfall \"Logs\" tab in Tempo, configure the Tempo datasource → Trace to logs → select your Loki datasource.*",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "How to use the drilldowns",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "id": 1,
      "title": "🚦 TRAFFIC — Request & Fetch Rate",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "HTTP requests per second to the Flask app. Exemplars on the bars link to Tempo traces. Exemplar dots carry two drilldown links: ① jump to the Tempo trace waterfall, ② jump to Loki logs filtered by that trace_id.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "req/s",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "→ Tempo: view trace",
              "url": "/explore?left={\"datasource\":\"${DS_TEMPO}\",\"queries\":[{\"query\":\"${__value.exemplar.traceID}\",\"queryType\":\"traceql\",\"refId\":\"A\",\"datasource\":{\"type\": \"tempo\", \"uid\": \"${DS_TEMPO}\"}}],\"range\":{\"from\":\"${__from}\",\"to\":\"${__to}\"}}"
            },
            {
              "title": "→ Loki: logs for this trace",
              "url": "/explore?left={\"datasource\":\"${DS_LOKI}\",\"queries\":[{\"expr\":\"{\\\"service_name\\\":\\\"flask-weather-app\\\"} | trace_id = \\\"${__value.exemplar.traceID}\\\"\",\"refId\":\"A\",\"datasource\":{\"type\": \"loki\", \"uid\": \"${DS_LOKI}\"}}],\"range\":{\"from\":\"${__from}\",\"to\":\"${__to}\"}}"
            }
          ],
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{service_name=\"flask-weather-app\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (route)",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "title": "Flask — HTTP Request Rate",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Weather + AQI fetch attempts per second. Exemplars link to collector traces. Exemplar dots carry two drilldown links: ① jump to the Tempo trace waterfall, ② jump to Loki logs filtered by that trace_id.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisLabel": "fetches/s",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "→ Tempo: view trace",
              "url": "/explore?left={\"datasource\":\"${DS_TEMPO}\",\"queries\":[{\"query\":\"${__value.exemplar.traceID}\",\"queryType\":\"traceql\",\"refId\":\"A\",\"datasource\":{\"type\": \"tempo\", \"uid\": \"${DS_TEMPO}\"}}],\"range\":{\"from\":\"${__from}\",\"to\":\"${__to}\"}}"
            },
            {
              "title": "→ Loki: logs for this trace",
              "url": "/explore?left={\"datasource\":\"${DS_LOKI}\",\"queries\":[{\"expr\":\"{\\\"service_name\\\":\\\"weather-collector-chennai\\\"} | trace_id = \\\"${__value.exemplar.traceID}\\\"\",\"refId\":\"A\",\"datasource\":{\"type\": \"loki\", \"uid\": \"${DS_LOKI}\"}}],\"range\":{\"from\":\"${__from}\",\"to\":\"${__to}\"}}"
            }
          ],
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(weather_fetch_total{service_name=\"weather-collector-chennai\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (source)",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "title": "Collector — Fetch Rate by Source",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
