      "description": "Ratio of failed fetches (weather + AQI) to total fetches. Click an exemplar dot to jump to the failing trace. Exemplar dots carry two drilldown links: ① jump to the Tempo trace waterfall, ② jump to Loki logs filtered by that trace_id.",
